00:07:27.599 --> 00:07:29.599
so this avoids it really nicely.

00:07:29.680 --> 00:07:33.359
But now I really rarely wear heavy makeup, so

00:07:33.759 --> 00:07:40.479
I don't really bother. So I decided for this video. I would only show products that I've been using for at least a month.

