00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:16.560
so it's a bit hard to say for sure

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:22.979
but I tend to feel that tretinoin doesn't really keep away my clogged pores. It's really the chemical exfoliants.

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:26.659
Last year I said that my skin was still super sensitive to tretinoin.

00:10:27.279 --> 00:10:34.559
So thankfully it is a lot less sensitive now. I hardly ever get massive peeling. I still only use it every three days

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:37.359
Maybe I've just gotten better at estimating how much I need.

00:10:37.839 --> 00:10:42.799
So I used to mix a quarter to a half pea sized blob of tretinoin with a few drops of oil

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:49.459
Now I tend to mix it with moisturizer instead of oil. I haven't really used oils that much recently.

