but it is quite a promising anti-aging ingredient and so I've been using this. And this also has tons of niacinamide which my skin

00:20:50.159 --> 00:20:55.759
does enjoy. I'm not sure how much niacinamide is actually in these, it is the second ingredient on the ingredients list

